flowchart LR
    S["Watch list<br/>sources"] --> SC["Scan<br/>fetch + hash"]
    SC --> D{"Compared to<br/>last snapshot"}
    D -->|changed| L["Lead"]
    D -->|disappeared| L
    D -->|failed to appear| L
    D -->|same| X["Nothing"]
